  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridges of Hope for 5000+Girls in Kampala City</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Join Katika Child Africa (KCA) in empowering 5000+ girls fight for their rights in public spaces in Kampala City. This project will build a Vocational skilling center for the most vulnerable girls in Kampala, providing hands-on skills in tailoring, hair dressing and employability skills. Further, sensitization in Entertainment places, Streets, Schools, Churches, Markets and Transportation means where girls are abused will be done. &amp; Support enforcement, deliver justice to victims of this abuse.</narrative>
  </description>
